  no_direction map ablations on val_unseen.
- eval_teacher_on_llm_maps.sh: the GT teacher read LLM maps (start_position
  scaled x2) or no map.
- eval_student_gt_full.sh: S5-style map swap (p0/gt_full/gt_seen) for a
