- check_pretrained_map_loading.py: CPU forensics for the map-path loading fix
  and fusion residual-gate norms.
- paired_analysis.py: per-episode paired comparison with scene-cluster
  bootstrap, exact McNemar, S/O/N transitions and stop-error decomposition.
- eval_dagger_distill.sh, summarize_eval.py: carried over from the review
  branch (dashed CLI names).

